{"3640570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Country Slime", "steam_appid": 3640570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/5e070ad5567a048fb6ed9cfb9c8e229c.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=270 height=118 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/5e070ad5567a048fb6ed9cfb9c8e229c.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/5e070ad5567a048fb6ed9cfb9c8e229c.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Exclusive Rewards : Sunglasses</strong><br>( Only for players who clear the demo. )</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Clear the Demo and Join the End Credits!</strong><br><br><br><br><strong>If you wishlist now, it will be a huge support!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Forage, cook and eat, upgrade your equipment, and enhance your skills to take down the boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">If you need a hand, team up with up to 4 players!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">You can form a team of up to 4 slimes on the same day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">( Join using a join code from the title screen )</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/a79f05936a411314f638b1e32b87e020.avif?t=1787638502\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※ Hold [F2] on keyboard or [Select] on gamepad for 5 seconds on the title screen to reset game and replay the tutorial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >※ Key Remapping(Keyboard) : Press [F2] while playing to display the control list, then click a control to change its assigned key.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Survival System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sanity <strong>:</strong> If it hits 0 and you collapse, the Slime's adventure comes to an end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food : Cook and eat to recover. This picky Slime needs cooked meat sometimes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Water : Refill mostly from wells. Thirst grows faster depending on the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Temp <strong>:</strong> Too hot or too cold, and you’ll start losing HP.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/7154b14de5ca9a398b8ec685510b1c8a.avif?t=1787638502\" width=174 height=122 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If these stats hit the limit, your HP and Sanity will gradually drain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sleep <strong>:</strong> HP and Sanity will drop as the night gets late. If you stay up too late, your Sanity will hit 0 and you’ll go down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gold<strong> :</strong> Used to enhance equipment at the anvil. Obtain it by smelting gold ore or offering loot to the Altar.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iron : Used to repair durability for swords and pickaxes. May have more uses in future updates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diamond : Used to learn and enhance skills somewhere in the forest. Also used for trading with NPCs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boss : If you fail to defeat the boss in time, strange anomalies will begin to appear.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■</strong> <strong>Combat System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guard : The core of the Slime's combat. Successful guards allow additional attacks and give short invincibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1ea6686b30e9d5f3cdb751178399f7b2.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1ea6686b30e9d5f3cdb751178399f7b2.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1ea6686b30e9d5f3cdb751178399f7b2.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge : Crouch to avoid attacks, or use an additional input to dodge with short invincibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2e6e2292743e57cd0143af5fe20f7548.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2e6e2292743e57cd0143af5fe20f7548.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2e6e2292743e57cd0143af5fe20f7548.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit Types : Various hit types exist, and single-target attacks can be tanked for your teammates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Element : Elemental advantages and interaction systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HP : Divided into segments for recovery. Some items let you heal past these limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment : Equip and enhance swords, pickaxes, and various accessories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats : Equipment have various stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Attacks : Weapons have effects like Electrocute, Burn, Poison, and Drain, which can be boosted by accessories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buffs : Includes Invincibility, Armor, and Damage Boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Debuffs : Includes common debuffs like Stun, Hold, Blind, and Confusion, as well as special monster debuffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills : Choose and equip 8 skills to create your own build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up : Up to 4 players can combine equipment and skills to make builds (e.g., Mage, Monk, Tank, Support, or Rogue).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Skill System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills may contain various hidden properties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic : Equipping a staff grants bonus damage at maximum range.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/a747bf160bc259a7bb2b1faf041b1ce7.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/a747bf160bc259a7bb2b1faf041b1ce7.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/a747bf160bc259a7bb2b1faf041b1ce7.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawl : Equipping hand-to-hand weapons grants bonus damage at close range.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/26b486d45996a714478401f298ab2a4d.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/26b486d45996a714478401f298ab2a4d.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/26b486d45996a714478401f298ab2a4d.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements : Skills are either non-elemental or belong to one of 8 elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun : Stuns enemies for a set duration. Stun resistance scales with stun duration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/5f9cc1353ac0689cfc0d9d268921bc85.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/5f9cc1353ac0689cfc0d9d268921bc85.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/5f9cc1353ac0689cfc0d9d268921bc85.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold : Works similarly to Stun, but can extend Stun or other Hold effects regardless of resistance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1f7fd9c050f5e6cedd1e053a272e3936.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1f7fd9c050f5e6cedd1e053a272e3936.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1f7fd9c050f5e6cedd1e053a272e3936.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weakness : Certain skills can expose enemy weaknesses when attacking from behind, increasing critical hit chance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2992ef3f939e48db955bd700445c954f.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2992ef3f939e48db955bd700445c954f.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2992ef3f939e48db955bd700445c954f.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break : Can break certain monster patterns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/9d1f5645a2b70a8709c5c7dea4a132c8.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/9d1f5645a2b70a8709c5c7dea4a132c8.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/9d1f5645a2b70a8709c5c7dea4a132c8.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal : Restores HP for yourself or your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cure : Removes physical debuffs for yourself or your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purify : Removes mental debuffs for yourself or your team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Future Patches</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Updates :</strong> Constantly evolving bosses, monsters, equipment, skills, and terrains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New survival elements and dynamic events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore : Unfold the story through short flavor texts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/b1d236897356046398515e194f406e37.avif?t=1787638502\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/5e070ad5567a048fb6ed9cfb9c8e229c.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=270 height=