rds allow additional attacks and give short invincibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1ea6686b30e9d5f3cdb751178399f7b2.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1ea6686b30e9d5f3cdb751178399f7b2.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1ea6686b30e9d5f3cdb751178399f7b2.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge : Crouch to avoid attacks, or use an additional input to dodge with short invincibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2e6e2292743e57cd0143af5fe20f7548.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2e6e2292743e57cd0143af5fe20f7548.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2e6e2292743e57cd0143af5fe20f7548.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit Types : Various hit types exist, and single-target attacks can be tanked for your teammates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Element : Elemental advantages and interaction systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >HP : Divided into segments for recovery. Some items let you heal past these limits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equipment : Equip and enhance swords, pickaxes, and various accessories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stats : Equipment have various stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special Attacks : Weapons have effects like Electrocute, Burn, Poison, and Drain, which can be boosted by accessories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buffs : Includes Invincibility, Armor, and Damage Boost.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Debuffs : Includes common debuffs like Stun, Hold, Blind, and Confusion, as well as special monster debuffs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills : Choose and equip 8 skills to create your own build.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up : Up to 4 players can combine equipment and skills to make builds (e.g., Mage, Monk, Tank, Support, or Rogue).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Skill System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skills may contain various hidden properties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic : Equipping a staff grants bonus damage at maximum range.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/a747bf160bc259a7bb2b1faf041b1ce7.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/a747bf160bc259a7bb2b1faf041b1ce7.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/a747bf160bc259a7bb2b1faf041b1ce7.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brawl : Equipping hand-to-hand weapons grants bonus damage at close range.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/26b486d45996a714478401f298ab2a4d.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/26b486d45996a714478401f298ab2a4d.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/26b486d45996a714478401f298ab2a4d.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elements : Skills are either non-elemental or belong to one of 8 elements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stun : Stuns enemies for a set duration. Stun resistance scales with stun duration.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/5f9cc1353ac0689cfc0d9d268921bc85.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/5f9cc1353ac0689cfc0d9d268921bc85.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/5f9cc1353ac0689cfc0d9d268921bc85.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold : Works similarly to Stun, but can extend Stun or other Hold effects regardless of resistance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1f7fd9c050f5e6cedd1e053a272e3936.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1f7fd9c050f5e6cedd1e053a272e3936.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/1f7fd9c050f5e6cedd1e053a272e3936.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weakness : Certain skills can expose enemy weaknesses when attacking from behind, increasing critical hit chance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2992ef3f939e48db955bd700445c954f.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2992ef3f939e48db955bd700445c954f.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/2992ef3f939e48db955bd700445c954f.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break : Can break certain monster patterns.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/9d1f5645a2b70a8709c5c7dea4a132c8.poster.avif?t=1787638502\" width=1080 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/9d1f5645a2b70a8709c5c7dea4a132c8.webm?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/9d1f5645a2b70a8709c5c7dea4a132c8.mp4?t=1787638502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heal : Restores HP for yourself or your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cure : Removes physical debuffs for yourself or your team.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purify : Removes mental debuffs for yourself or your team.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>■ Future Patches</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Updates :</strong> Constantly evolving bosses, monsters, equipment, skills, and terrains.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New survival elements and dynamic events.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lore : Unfold the story through short flavor texts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/extras/b1d236897356046398515e194f406e37.avif?t=1787638502\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p>", "short_description": "RPG-style co-op survival - Country Slime", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Korean, Russian, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Brazil", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/dab04298666c8201dd6f9c8aaa323d7264d15553/header.jpg?t=1787638502", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/8e75069c3f14251cfbb112e29dc86aa0e5a0caf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787638502", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640570/8e75069c3f14251cfbb112e29dc86aa0e5a0caf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787638502", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 1.8 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce 980